# driver_leave.func

> Module: driver_leave (İzin Takvimi) | Category: HR

## Purpose
Driver leave (izin) calendar and approval workflow. Track all employee time-off requests with Turkish leave types, approval states, and date ranges. Added in v2.34.

## Problems It Solves
- Turkish labor law mandates specific leave types (annual, weekly rest, sick, bereavement)
- Fleet owners need to plan driver availability around leave schedules
- Approval workflow: pending → approved/rejected
- Prevent scheduling conflicts (two drivers on leave same day)
- Link to trip planning (don't assign trip to driver on leave)

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `driver_leave`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| personel_id | INTEGER FK | Linked to employees.id |
| izin_turu | izin_turu_enum | Leave type |
| baslangic_tarihi | DATE | Start date |
| bitis_tarihi | DATE | End date |
| onay_durumu | izin_onay_enum | Approval status |
| aciklama | TEXT | Notes |
| created_at, updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamps |

**Enums:**
- `izin_turu_enum`: YILLIK_IZIN, HAFTALIK_IZIN, UCRETSIZ_IZIN, SAGLIK_IZNI, MAZERET_IZNI
- `izin_onay_enum`: BEKLIYOR, ONAYLANDI, REDDEDILDI

## User Interface
**DriverLeavePage.tsx** — `/dashboard/driver-leave`
- DataGrid table: Personel, İzin Türü, Başlangıç, Bitiş, Onay Durumu, Açıklama
- Approval status badges: yellow (pending), green (approved), red (rejected)
- Add modal: employee selector, leave type, date range, description
- Approval buttons per row (approve/reject)
- Calendar view (date overlap detection)
- Export to CSV/Excel/PDF

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/driver-leave/` | Tenant JWT | List leave records |
| POST | `/api/tenant/driver-leave/` | Tenant JWT | Create leave request |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/driver-leave/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Edit |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/driver-leave/{id}/status` | Tenant JWT | Approve/reject |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/driver-leave/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Remove |

